{"seq":3,"slug":"capacity-overload-backpressure","title":"产能过载下的背压、限流与承诺降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/ctp-capacity-capable-promise/capacity-overload-backpressure","wordCount":3018,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"产能过载下的背压-限流与承诺降级\">产能过载下的背压、限流与承诺降级</h1><p>零点大促的瞬间，商品详情页每秒涌进十几万次「什么时候能到」的询价，而后端那晚只有两千个待打包工位、三家承运商的固定取件额度。承诺链路的输入是无限可重复触发的读流量，输出却被物理产能死死卡住——这个不对称是 CTP 引擎最脆弱的部位。它不像下单接口那样天生有幂等键与库存扣减当闸门，一次未被保护的过载就能让承诺服务雪崩，并把「交期不准」传染给已对买家确认过的订单。本文处理过载态下的三件事：把下游产能压力<strong>背压</strong>回入口、对入口<strong>限流</strong>并按价值分配稀缺产能额度，以及确实排不下时把承诺<strong>降级</strong>成有代价但仍可信的答案。产能约束建模见 <a href=\"capacity-constraint-modeling\">产能约束建模</a>，求解与降级选项见 <a href=\"ctp-feasibility-solver\">CTP 可行性求解</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-承诺服务为何比订单服务更易过载\">核心概念：承诺服务为何比订单服务更易过载</h2><p>承诺服务与订单服务的负载性质根本不同，保护手段也必须不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>读放大且无幂等闸门</strong>。一张订单只写一次，同一个 SKU 的询价却可被任意买家、比价插件、爬虫、购物车预览重复触发。下单天然被库存扣减挡住，询价没有这层刹车。</li>\n<li><strong>单次计算昂贵</strong>。ATP 扣减是一次原子操作；CTP 要读瓶颈资源占用并求解带容量约束的可行性问题，成本高一个数量级，且求解依赖的产能数据在过载时本身也在变慢。</li>\n<li><strong>过载会自我强化</strong>。求解变慢 → 客户端超时重试 → 负载翻倍 → 队列更深 → 更慢。Google SRE 把这种正反馈称为重试风暴，是级联故障的首要成因（<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/addressing-cascading-failures/\">Google SRE Book, <em>Addressing Cascading Failures</em></a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>后果不对称</strong>。少卖一单只损失毛利；错一个交期既损失买家信任，又让错误承诺落库占用瓶颈产能，形成比库存超卖更隐蔽的产能超卖。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[大促流量尖峰] --&gt; B[承诺请求队列]&#10;    B --&gt; C{求解是否变慢?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[客户端超时重试]&#10;    D --&gt;|放大 2-3x| B&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[正常求解]&#10;    E --&gt; F[写入产能占用]&#10;    B -.保护点1.-&gt; G[背压: 入口准入]&#10;    G -.保护点2.-&gt; H[限流: 分级配额]&#10;    H -.保护点3.-&gt; I[降级: 保守承诺]&#10;    I --&gt; J[仍可信的答复]&#10;    D -.熔断.-&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[大促流量尖峰] --&gt; B[承诺请求队列]\n    B --&gt; C{求解是否变慢?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[客户端超时重试]\n    D --&gt;|放大 2-3x| B\n    C --&gt;|否| E[正常求解]\n    E --&gt; F[写入产能占用]\n    B -.保护点1.-&gt; G[背压: 入口准入]\n    G -.保护点2.-&gt; H[限流: 分级配额]\n    H -.保护点3.-&gt; I[降级: 保守承诺]\n    I --&gt; J[仍可信的答复]\n    D -.熔断.-&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"背压-把瓶颈负荷率倒推成入口准入速率\">背压：把瓶颈负荷率倒推成入口准入速率</h2><p>背压的本质是<strong>上游按下游真正能处理的速率发送</strong>。对承诺服务而言，下游不是某个微服务，而是瓶颈物理资源——工位、承运日配额、清关通道。因此准入速率应由瓶颈负荷率反推，而非由本服务的 CPU 或队列深度间接猜测：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>admit</mtext></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≤</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>bottleneck</mtext></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>r</mi></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>Committed</mtext><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{admit}} \\;\\le\\; \\mu_{\\text{bottleneck}} \\;=\\; \\min_{r} \\frac{C_r - \\text{Committed}_r}{a_r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">admit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bottleneck</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Committed</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是资源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的单位时间容量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每单对该资源的定额占用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Committed</mtext><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Committed}_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Committed</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是已承诺订单的存量占用。取所有资源最小值意味着<strong>瓶颈决定准入</strong>——宽松资源不该允许更多流量涌入，否则只是把压力堆到瓶颈前面。队列深度也必须由可接受时延反推：由 Little 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>，若承诺响应预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>budget</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{budget}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">budget</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（买家等待耐心通常 200–500 ms），则队列上限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>admit</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>budget</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\max} = \\lambda_{\\text{admit}} \\cdot W_{\\text{budget}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">admit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">budget</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就应拒绝而非排队——<strong>无界队列把过载从延迟问题转化为内存溢出问题</strong>。背压的实现形态有三类：有界队列加立即拒绝、信号量式并发上限、以及在响应里携带明确的重试时间。后者的标准表达是 HTTP 429 加 <code>Retry-After</code> 头（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6585\">RFC 6585</a>），IETF HTTPAPI 工作组正在标准化的 RateLimit 头字段族进一步让客户端能自行配速而非盲目重试。一个务实细节：商详询价的背压出口应返回<strong>缓存的保守交期区间</strong>而非赤裸错误，否则流量会被挤向更昂贵的重试路径；结算台的承诺请求则必须保留独立配额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限流-多租户配额-并发上限与自适应阈值\">限流：多租户配额、并发上限与自适应阈值</h2><p>限流回答「谁在什么条件下能用多少」。承诺服务流量来源差异极大，一刀切限流会误伤最有价值的请求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流量来源</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>限流策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SEO / 比价爬虫</td>\n<td>高 QPS、低转化、可缓存</td>\n<td>严格独立配额，命中缓存直接返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未登录商详预览</td>\n<td>突发、可容忍区间值</td>\n<td>令牌桶限流，超限返回区间承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已登录购物车</td>\n<td>中等、有会话</td>\n<td>按账号维度配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算台承诺</td>\n<td>低 QPS、高价值</td>\n<td>专用通道，永不与询价共享配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后台补算 / 对账</td>\n<td>可延迟、批处理</td>\n<td>排队执行，只在大盘空闲时放行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>令牌桶适合允许突发的场景（参数为速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 与桶容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>），漏桶则平滑输出、不允许突发。选择取决于该流量是否「突发无害」——商详预览允许突发（缓存能吸收），结算承诺不允许（它占用真实产能）。对变成本请求，<strong>并发上限比 QPS 上限更稳</strong>：CTP 单次求解耗时随订单复杂度（SKU 数、候选节点数、约束条数）剧烈变化，固定 QPS 要么在复杂订单时打爆 CPU、要么在简单订单时浪费额度。Netflix 提出的自适应并发限制从观测到的延迟与在途并发反推可承载并发（Little 定律的在线应用，见 Netflix Tech Blog, <em>Performance Under Load</em>），在请求成本方差大的场景显著优于静态 QPS。Google SRE 的客户端自适应限流（adaptive throttling）则在本地请求数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 与实际被接受数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的比值超过倍数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>（通常取 2）时按概率拒绝：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>reject</mtext></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{reject}} \\;=\\; \\max\\left(0,\\ \\frac{R - K \\cdot A}{R + 1}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reject</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的妙处在于<strong>不需要全局共识</strong>，每个副本独立收敛，能迅速在重试风暴中压住总流量。限流器应放在最便宜的一层之后：先过缓存、再进限流，让被拒绝的请求尽量不消耗求解资源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排队与优先级-截止时间感知的调度纪律\">排队与优先级：截止时间感知的调度纪律</h2><p>承诺请求都带 deadline——买家在页面上等 300 ms 还没拿到交期就滚走了，<strong>超过 deadline 的结果价值为零</strong>。这个性质决定了过载下的排队纪律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FIFO 在过载下表现最差</strong>。长队列里排在前面的大多是已经过期、即将被丢弃的老请求，服务它们等于全部白算。LIFO 加短队列能让大部分仍然新鲜、尚有救的请求被及时服务。</li>\n<li><strong>丢弃过期项</strong>。类似 CoDel 主动队列管理对滞留过久报文的丢弃（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8289\">RFC 8289</a>），出队时先检查 deadline，已过则直接返回保守承诺、不消耗求解资源。</li>\n<li><strong>关键性分级</strong>。Google SRE 用 criticality 区分请求重要性——结算承诺 &gt; 商详询价 &gt; 后台补算，高关键性请求在过载时优先获得容量，辅以 EDF（最早截止优先）逼近最优可调度性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>优先级队列必须防饥饿：纯高优先级优先会让低优先级请求永久排队，因此要引入老化（等待越久优先级越高）或加权公平队列（WFQ），确保后台补算也在大盘空闲时得到吞吐。否则「保护」会把一类流量彻底饿死，反过来破坏承诺数据自身的完整性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺降级-沿保守方向收缩精度-而非正确性\">承诺降级：沿保守方向收缩精度，而非正确性</h2><p>降级是过载保护的最后一层，也是承诺服务区别于普通 API 的地方。这里有一条铁律：<strong>降级只能让承诺更保守，绝不能更激进</strong>——降级后的承诺 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>⪰</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat d \\succeq d^\\ast</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0938em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⪰</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（更晚或更宽的区间），因为一个乐观的错承诺直接等于产能超卖，而产能超卖比库存超卖更隐蔽：库存超卖在拣货时立刻暴露，产能超卖要等到排产全面延误才浮现。</p>\n<p>降级不是随机抽掉功能，而是一个有明确触发阈值、监控与自动回退的阶梯：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>输出形态</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0 精确求解</td>\n<td>正常负载</td>\n<td>精确交期 + 置信度</td>\n<td>高 CPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 缓存 / 近似</td>\n<td>求解队列变长</td>\n<td>预计算交期区间</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 静态承诺</td>\n<td>产能数据不可用</td>\n<td>品类历史 P90 交期</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 区间承诺</td>\n<td>不确定性高</td>\n<td>「3 月 12–14 日」而非单日</td>\n<td>转化体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 延迟承诺</td>\n<td>请求与产能双超</td>\n<td>「下单后 X 天发货」</td>\n<td>转化率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5 拒绝 / 候补</td>\n<td>各级皆不可行</td>\n<td>429 或加入候补名单</td>\n<td>流失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个概念必须分清：L1–L5 是<strong>保护性降级</strong>，由过载触发、目的是保住服务本身，对买家透明；而「加急、换承运商、拆单」是<strong>业务性降级</strong>，由买家或订单价值触发、目的是保住这一单，对买家可见且可能产生费用。混在一起会导致过载时错发升舱优惠，或在买家本该加急时静默给他更差的交期。降级还必须可观测、可回退：每个级别要有进入与退出阈值（两者间留滞后带，避免等级抖动），并在承诺 SLA 报表里区分「正常承诺」与「降级承诺」各自的兑现率，否则降级会悄悄侵蚀服务质量却无人察觉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过载信号与自适应闭环\">过载信号与自适应闭环</h2><p>保护要自动运行，就必须有稳定的过载信号和下压决策。人工调参在大促面前永远慢半拍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>超阈值动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>瓶颈负荷率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>产能占用 / 容量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 停止新增承诺占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求解队列等待 p99</td>\n<td>排队深度</td>\n<td>超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>budget</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{budget}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">budget</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 触发 L1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求解耗时 p99</td>\n<td>单次计算成本</td>\n<td>上升即降并发上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺拒绝率</td>\n<td>通道健康度</td>\n<td>持续高即降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端重试率</td>\n<td>正反馈强度</td>\n<td>上升即启用自适应限流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>调节器常用 AIMD（加性增、乘性减）：观测周期内未过载则线性增加准入额度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\leftarrow \\lambda + \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，检测到过载则乘性收缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\leftarrow \\beta \\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，典型 0.7）。<strong>加性增要慢、乘性减要快</strong>——扩容保守是为了不把自己推回过载，收缩果断是为了在雪崩前刹车。最后，保护机制必须被压测验证：用<strong>高于瓶颈产能的合成流量</strong>打承诺服务，断言 (a) 承诺总量不超过产能（无超卖）、(b) 降级方向始终保守（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>⪰</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat d \\succeq d^\\ast</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0938em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⪰</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、(c) 流量回落后自动逐级回到 L0。只测正常流量等于没测过保护机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>产能过载保护把 CTP 从「能算」推进到「在压力下仍然可信」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>承诺服务的读放大、无幂等闸门与自我强化特性，使它比订单服务更易雪崩，保护必须前置。</li>\n<li><strong>背压</strong>把瓶颈负荷率倒推成入口准入速率，队列上限由 Little 定律给出。</li>\n<li><strong>限流</strong>要分级配额、并发优于 QPS，并可用自适应阈值在无全局共识下压住重试风暴。</li>\n<li><strong>排队</strong>要截止时间感知，FIFO 在过载下最差，优先级需防饥饿。</li>\n<li><strong>降级</strong>只能沿保守方向收缩精度，分保护性与业务性两层，且必须可观测、可回退。</li>\n<li>过载保护必须用超产能合成流量压测验证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>承诺质量的最终度量落在兑现率与偏差上，监控口径见 <a href=\"../promise-operations-monitoring/promise-exception-replanning\">承诺异常重规划</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考来源\">参考来源</h2><ul>\n<li>Google SRE Book, <em>Handling Overload</em>：<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/\">https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/</a></li>\n<li>Google SRE Book, <em>Addressing Cascading Failures</em>：<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/addressing-cascading-failures/\">https://sre.google/sre-book/addressing-cascading-failures/</a></li>\n<li>AWS Builders&#39; Library, <em>Using load shedding to avoid overload</em></li>\n<li>IETF <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6585\">RFC 6585</a> — 429 与 Retry-After；<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8289\">RFC 8289</a> — CoDel 队列管理</li>\n<li>Netflix Tech Blog, <em>Performance Under Load</em> — 自适应并发限制</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>具体阈值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>budget</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{budget}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">budget</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等）应结合自身产能历史数据标定，而非直接照搬。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"产能过载下的背压、限流与承诺降级","id":"产能过载下的背压-限流与承诺降级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：承诺服务为何比订单服务更易过载","id":"核心概念-承诺服务为何比订单服务更易过载"},{"level":2,"text":"背压：把瓶颈负荷率倒推成入口准入速率","id":"背压-把瓶颈负荷率倒推成入口准入速率"},{"level":2,"text":"限流：多租户配额、并发上限与自适应阈值","id":"限流-多租户配额-并发上限与自适应阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"排队与优先级：截止时间感知的调度纪律","id":"排队与优先级-截止时间感知的调度纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺降级：沿保守方向收缩精度，而非正确性","id":"承诺降级-沿保守方向收缩精度-而非正确性"},{"level":2,"text":"过载信号与自适应闭环","id":"过载信号与自适应闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考来源","id":"参考来源"}],"prev":{"title":"CTP 可行性求解与瓶颈资源识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/ctp-capacity-capable-promise/ctp-feasibility-solver"},"next":{"title":"承诺准确性度量：PD/PT 达成率与破损过期分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/promise-operations-monitoring/promise-accuracy-metrics"}}